<h2 id="about">A <strong class="text-gradient">corporate-free</strong> website starter kit that gets you up to zero.</h2>
<p class="lead">ZeroPoint is a free and open-source website starter kit that helps you get your website project up and running quickly. Using ZeroPoint Starter Kit you can create a statically-generated website with your content in just a few minutes.</p>
<p class="lead">Focusing on simplicity, version control, and native web technology, ZeroPoint provides a solid foundation for your website without the bloat of unnecessary databases, server-side languages, frameworks or monolithic content management systems.</p>
